  abilityDesc: 25 combo massive Fire, Water, Thunder, Dark attack on all foes, adds
    probable evasion for 3 turns, probability of raising allies from KO, hugely boosts
    own Atk, Def, Rec for 3 turns & Spark damage greatly boosts BB gauge and greatly
    restores HP for 3 turns
